
# Forjora

> **Connecting Builders. Creating Opportunities.**

Forjora is a student-focused collaboration platform designed exclusively for college and university students. It provides a centralized ecosystem where students can discover teammates, collaborate on projects, participate in hackathons, find research collaborators, showcase their work, and receive AI-powered guidance.

Forjora aims to reduce the fragmentation students currently experience when working on technical, academic, research, and hackathon-related activities.

---

# 1. Project Overview

College students often use multiple disconnected platforms for finding teammates, communicating with teams, managing projects, discovering hackathons, collaborating on research, and showcasing their work.

Forjora brings these activities together into a single platform.

Instead of using one platform for communication, another for project management, another for discovering events, and another for showcasing work, students can use Forjora as a centralized collaboration ecosystem.

The platform focuses specifically on **student collaboration and learning**, rather than professional hiring or freelancing.

