# 13. GitHub Integration

GitHub integration is one of the core features of Forjora.

Students can connect their GitHub profiles to:

* Display repositories
* Showcase technical work
* Link repositories to projects
* Display contribution activity
* Demonstrate development experience

GitHub activity can also contribute to the project's overall health monitoring system.

