# 14. Project Health Monitor

Forjora provides a Project Health system designed to give teams a quick understanding of their project's current condition.

The health score can consider:

* Recent GitHub commits
* Task completion
* Team activity
* Pending tasks
* Project deadlines
* Development activity

The objective is to help teams identify whether their project is progressing normally or requires attention.

